#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD2222 expect=violation domain=TS
#note "TS carries only the secondary outcome measure; no TSPARMCD=OUTMSPRI record -> the Primary Outcome Measure parameter is missing, one dataset-level finding."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S01 | TS | 1 | TITLE    | Trial Title | A Phase 3 Study of Drug X in Subjects With Condition Y
S01 | TS | 2 | OUTMSSEC | Secondary Outcome Measure | Time to first hospitalisation
S01 | TS | 3 | TTYPE    | Trial Type | EFFICACY
